## 📦 Installation & Quick Start

### Method A: Standalone Executable (Recommended)
1. Download the latest `spyder_ai_copilot.exe` (or release package) from the [Releases](https://github.com/weijj24-cmd/spyder_ai_copilot/releases) page.
2. Launch the executable. When prompted, enter your Google Gemini API Key (or set the `GEMINI_API_KEY` environment variable).
3. Type your development prompt (e.g., *"Write a function to parse CSV using pandas with error handling"*).
4. Type `exit` or `quit` to terminate the session.

### Method B: Run from Source

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/weijj24-cmd/spyder_ai_copilot.git](https://github.com/weijj24-cmd/spyder_ai_copilot.git)
cd spyder_ai_copilot

# 2. Install required SDK dependencies
pip install google-genai

# 3. Configure API Key (PowerShell / CMD)
set GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 4. Execute the copilot
python spyder_ai_copilot.py
